  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investing in durable dairy development in Tanga, Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the study is to confirm the commercial and technical feasibility of the technology of Independent Energy B.V. and its partners, for a self-sufficient dairy farm in the Tanga region in Tanzania.The project will contribute to job availability in the region by creating 20 to 25 FTE. If the farm is established, 30 to 50 local smallholder farmers will be involved to supply fresh milk.Because the dairy farm will be technologically advanced, there is ample opportunity to transfer knowledge and train local dairy farmers. To facilitate this process, a tailor-made training programme will be established.</narrative>
  </description>
